WEBVTT

00:00:04.110 --> 00:00:06.860
Wh-Why are you here?

00:00:07.520 --> 00:00:08.870
I was invited.

00:00:09.340 --> 00:00:10.360
By a friend.

00:00:10.690 --> 00:00:13.100
Your uniform... You go to Reihou?

00:00:13.100 --> 00:00:17.350
Reihou's a prestigious all-girls school
 just like Hakuou, isn't it?

00:00:17.350 --> 00:00:18.400
Yes.

00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:20.830
I'm a third-year at Reihou Girls' School.

00:00:21.420 --> 00:00:23.370
I'm a spunky 18-year-old.

00:00:23.840 --> 00:00:26.190
I wanted to apologize to you both.

00:00:26.190 --> 00:00:29.380
That's why I interrupted 
your conversation. I'm sorry.

00:00:29.850 --> 00:00:30.700
Huh?

00:00:30.700 --> 00:00:31.840
Onee-chan!

00:00:33.480 --> 00:00:35.510
Huh? You!

00:00:35.750 --> 00:00:37.280
Towano Chikai!

00:00:37.280 --> 00:00:39.620
What are you doing at an all-girls school?!

00:00:39.620 --> 00:00:41.520
A-Are you some kind of pervert?

00:00:41.520 --> 00:00:43.370
N-No, I'm not!

00:00:43.370 --> 00:00:45.520
This is my little sister's school!

00:00:45.960 --> 00:00:47.390
You look pretty laid back.

00:00:47.390 --> 00:00:49.020
Finished your manuscript already?

00:00:49.360 --> 00:00:50.220
Well...

00:00:50.990 --> 00:00:51.520
Hmph.

00:00:51.890 --> 00:00:53.980
Guess it makes no difference 
if you write it or not.

00:00:53.980 --> 00:00:56.000
You're competing against us,

00:00:56.000 --> 00:00:58.020
so you're guaranteed to lose.

00:00:58.490 --> 00:01:01.290
That's why your little sister's 
consoling you, ain't it?

00:01:01.750 --> 00:01:02.830
Just so you know,

00:01:02.830 --> 00:01:04.540
I have no intention of losing to you.

00:01:04.820 --> 00:01:07.830
But you have no hope of beating us 
with Ah-he the way she is now.

00:01:08.670 --> 00:01:11.260
You're a fan of Double 
Peace-sensei's work, right?

00:01:11.720 --> 00:01:15.090
So how did your relationship 
with her end up so twisted?

00:01:16.360 --> 00:01:18.090
Ah-he told you that, did she?

00:01:18.400 --> 00:01:21.350
Yeah. Sensei said she didn't know 
what your beef was, though.

00:01:22.500 --> 00:01:25.350
Because she's wasting her talent!

00:01:25.640 --> 00:01:26.180
Huh?

00:01:26.720 --> 00:01:28.100
What do you mean by that?

00:01:28.400 --> 00:01:32.980
Don't go poking your nose in when 
you know nothing about Ah-he!

00:01:36.010 --> 00:01:38.300
Please leave my brother alone.

00:01:38.300 --> 00:01:40.780
Hey, this has nothing to do with you.

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:42.320
Yes, it does!

00:01:42.320 --> 00:01:43.480
Suzuka!

00:01:44.330 --> 00:01:47.760
O-Onii-chan, please let go of me.

00:01:47.760 --> 00:01:49.040
Just calm down.

00:01:49.040 --> 00:01:51.580
N-No, you can't...

00:01:52.580 --> 00:01:53.960
S-Stop!

00:01:54.480 --> 00:01:56.820
This has taken a turn for the ridiculous.

00:01:57.280 --> 00:01:59.430
Onee-chan, let's go home already.

00:02:01.270 --> 00:02:04.270
Oh! Hey, hold on! You haven't...

00:02:04.720 --> 00:02:05.940
What did you mean?

00:02:06.750 --> 00:02:07.520
You're groping her.

00:02:07.880 --> 00:02:08.490
Huh?

00:02:09.600 --> 00:02:10.340
Her breasts.

00:02:13.440 --> 00:02:15.530
O-Onii-chan...

00:02:15.530 --> 00:02:18.990
Sorry, Suzuka!

00:03:50.290 --> 00:03:55.420
Episode 7: My Sister and I Face a Doujinshi Contest We Can't Lose

00:03:54.460 --> 00:03:57.630
Onii-chan, you're the worst pervert ever.

00:03:57.800 --> 00:03:59.380
I'm really sorry.

00:04:00.120 --> 00:04:03.360
Uh, the deadline for 
the scenario is tomorrow.

00:04:03.360 --> 00:04:04.640
Are we gonna make it?

00:04:04.930 --> 00:04:08.140
Yes. I should finish writing it tonight.

00:04:08.140 --> 00:04:09.680
I see.

00:04:10.110 --> 00:04:11.450
Thank goodness.

00:04:11.450 --> 00:04:15.560
I've already stalled Double Peace-sensei 
and the printers as long as I dare.

00:04:18.950 --> 00:04:20.600
Hey, Suzuka?

00:04:20.600 --> 00:04:21.340
Huh?

00:04:21.340 --> 00:04:22.860
What is it, Onii-chan?

00:04:23.280 --> 00:04:25.360
You looked like you were spacing out there.

00:04:25.360 --> 00:04:26.370
Is something wrong?

00:04:26.580 --> 00:04:29.870
No, I think I'm just getting a little tired.

00:04:29.870 --> 00:04:31.430
Thank you for the food.

00:04:32.200 --> 00:04:33.370
I'll handle the dishes.

00:04:33.750 --> 00:04:35.300
I know you're feeling tired,

00:04:35.300 --> 00:04:36.880
but can you finish up the scenario?

00:04:37.120 --> 00:04:38.050
Sure.

00:04:38.050 --> 00:04:40.470
Thank you, Onii-chan.

00:04:52.600 --> 00:04:53.280
Huh?!

00:04:54.680 --> 00:04:57.690
Suzuka usually would've woken me up by now...

00:04:58.480 --> 00:04:59.560
Suzuka?

00:04:59.560 --> 00:05:00.690
Are you in there?

00:05:06.190 --> 00:05:07.130
I'm coming in.

00:05:12.750 --> 00:05:13.660
Don't tell me...

00:05:14.720 --> 00:05:16.420
You're burning up.

00:05:17.630 --> 00:05:19.420
Oh, Onii-chan.

00:05:20.030 --> 00:05:22.360
I'm sorry. I slept in...

00:05:22.360 --> 00:05:24.700
Y-You idiot. Go back to sleep.

00:05:24.700 --> 00:05:26.430
You have a fever.

00:05:26.670 --> 00:05:28.760
I was trying to write the scenario,

00:05:28.760 --> 00:05:30.800
but I started getting a headache,

00:05:30.800 --> 00:05:33.120
so I laid down to take a short break and...

00:05:33.960 --> 00:05:34.930
I'm sorry...

00:05:35.190 --> 00:05:36.920
It's fine. Just sleep.

00:05:36.920 --> 00:05:38.440
I'll go get you some medicine.

00:05:41.220 --> 00:05:42.560
Here. It's rice porridge.

00:05:44.920 --> 00:05:47.200
Thank you very much, Onii-chan.

00:05:47.770 --> 00:05:49.840
There's no need to thank me.

00:05:50.330 --> 00:05:51.950
Is there anything else you want?

00:05:52.800 --> 00:05:56.500
I feel a little icky because 
I've been sweating so much...

00:05:56.500 --> 00:05:58.460
Oh, you need a change of clothes?

00:06:09.520 --> 00:06:10.950
Onii-chan.

00:06:10.950 --> 00:06:13.180
S-Sorry! I didn't mean to look!

00:06:13.690 --> 00:06:17.430
Onii-chan, could you pick out
a pair you like for me?

00:06:17.750 --> 00:06:18.880
Huh?!

00:06:18.880 --> 00:06:22.520
<i>P-Pick out a pair I like?
 Wh-What does she mean by that?!</i>

00:06:22.520 --> 00:06:25.000
<i>She's going to wear the pair I like best?</i>

00:06:25.000 --> 00:06:26.840
<i>There's no way that'd happen!</i>

00:06:26.840 --> 00:06:28.570
<i>Pull yourself together, man!</i>

00:06:31.910 --> 00:06:34.910
<i>Still, what kind of situation 
have I found myself in?</i>

00:06:35.670 --> 00:06:37.660
<i>I've just opened my little sister's closet,</i>

00:06:37.660 --> 00:06:40.540
<i>and she's going to wear whatever 
underwear I pick out for her?</i>

00:06:41.040 --> 00:06:45.530
<i>Holy moly... I don't even understand
what I'm thinking anymore.</i>

00:06:47.250 --> 00:06:48.360
Onii-chan.

00:06:49.120 --> 00:06:49.770
Yes?!

00:06:55.350 --> 00:06:57.180
S-Suzuka-san?!

00:06:57.180 --> 00:07:00.040
Could you wipe my body down for me?

00:07:00.040 --> 00:07:01.440
B-But!

00:07:02.440 --> 00:07:03.910
Please.

00:07:05.830 --> 00:07:06.690
All right.

00:07:10.340 --> 00:07:12.260
Here comes the towel, Suzuka.

00:07:12.760 --> 00:07:14.910
Okay, Onii-chan.

00:07:30.160 --> 00:07:31.800
D-Does it hurt?

00:07:35.060 --> 00:07:38.810
More... please... Onii-chan.

00:07:42.140 --> 00:07:45.060
R-Right, now you're going 
to rest up and take it easy.

00:07:45.060 --> 00:07:48.350
If your fever hasn't gone 
down by tomorrow... Hey!

00:07:48.350 --> 00:07:50.110
I need to write the scenario.

00:07:51.030 --> 00:07:52.040
No!

00:07:52.040 --> 00:07:53.070
You need to rest!

00:07:53.590 --> 00:07:56.850
But if we don't turn the scenario in today,

00:07:56.850 --> 00:07:58.580
we'll miss our deadline, won't we?

00:07:58.780 --> 00:07:59.700
Well...

00:08:00.330 --> 00:08:04.580
But if we can get Double Peace-sensei 
to hold off for a bit, we should be okay.

00:08:04.930 --> 00:08:07.600
But there's no telling 
when I'll get over this cold.

00:08:07.600 --> 00:08:11.450
I can't stand the thought of us 
losing by default because of me.

00:08:11.920 --> 00:08:12.850
No.

00:08:12.850 --> 00:08:14.160
Even so, you can't!

00:08:14.160 --> 00:08:16.600
I can't let you write when you're in this state!

00:08:19.480 --> 00:08:22.100
Then, I have a favor to ask of you.

00:08:22.520 --> 00:08:24.600
What is it? Ask me anything.

00:08:25.170 --> 00:08:28.110
Could you write the scenario 
for me, Onii-chan?

00:08:28.920 --> 00:08:29.890
Me?!

00:08:29.890 --> 00:08:32.050
You're the only other person who can write it,

00:08:32.050 --> 00:08:35.110
because you went on the 
fact-finding mission with me.

00:08:35.330 --> 00:08:38.010
But I'm not a real writer.

00:08:38.440 --> 00:08:39.870
I can't do what you do...

00:08:40.260 --> 00:08:41.870
You can, Onii-chan.

00:08:43.760 --> 00:08:44.870
Suzuka...

00:08:47.160 --> 00:08:47.890
Huh?

00:08:47.890 --> 00:08:49.880
It's not finished yet?

00:08:50.330 --> 00:08:53.170
I... I'm sorry.

00:08:53.170 --> 00:08:56.680
No, no, please don't apologize.

00:08:56.680 --> 00:09:01.180
But it's rare for you to turn 
your manuscripts in late, isn't it?

00:09:03.190 --> 00:09:07.140
Well, anyway, I've drawn several 
rough copies in line with our theme.

00:09:07.140 --> 00:09:08.900
I think I've done some good work here.

00:09:13.090 --> 00:09:15.820
Th-They're incredible, but...

00:09:16.230 --> 00:09:20.240
These are your usual obscene, 
rape-filled, erotic illustrations.

00:09:20.550 --> 00:09:21.990
Aren't they just?

00:09:22.450 --> 00:09:25.400
Two siblings go on a date to the erotic
paradise that is an all-girls school,

00:09:25.400 --> 00:09:27.040
so the artwork <i>has </i>to be raunchy!

00:09:27.040 --> 00:09:29.150
The totally submissive little sister...

00:09:29.150 --> 00:09:33.100
discovers a fetish for the masochistic
 in front of her friends' eyes.

00:09:33.100 --> 00:09:37.010
Ah! Just imagining it is getting 
my juices flowing to the max!

00:09:37.260 --> 00:09:39.010
Double Peace-sensei.

00:09:39.370 --> 00:09:41.510
That style is a nonstarter!

00:09:41.510 --> 00:09:44.020
What?!

00:09:44.530 --> 00:09:47.290
The quality of the art may be 
important in this head-to-head,

00:09:47.760 --> 00:09:50.020
but how the reader reacts to it is key!

00:09:50.560 --> 00:09:54.900
To ensure a positive response, our content 
needs to appeal to a general audience.

00:09:55.210 --> 00:09:57.400
Oh... I see...

00:09:57.640 --> 00:09:58.380
Um...

00:09:59.580 --> 00:10:03.160
You're right. After all, 
it's your career on the line here.

00:10:04.650 --> 00:10:08.490
S-So do you think you could redraw these 
so they're a bit more mainstream?

00:10:08.490 --> 00:10:11.540
I'll whack out the scenario in the meantime.

00:10:15.320 --> 00:10:16.080
<i>All right.</i>

00:10:16.460 --> 00:10:17.740
<i>We already have the basic plot.</i>

00:10:18.490 --> 00:10:20.900
<i>I should be fine as long 
as I stick to the premise.</i>

00:10:21.400 --> 00:10:22.790
<i>I need to write something that'll sell.</i>

00:10:23.280 --> 00:10:25.390
<i>Something our readers will enjoy...</i>

00:10:36.680 --> 00:10:37.790
<i>It's no use.</i>

00:10:37.790 --> 00:10:40.120
<i>Even though it's just flirting 
at a culture festival,</i>

00:10:40.120 --> 00:10:41.900
<i>there's too much to consider.</i>

00:10:43.360 --> 00:10:46.060
<i>I should just focus on 
appealing to a mass audience.</i>

00:10:46.660 --> 00:10:49.780
<i>I don't know what's right or wrong
or how I should go about this.</i>

00:10:50.400 --> 00:10:51.960
<i>But even so, I have to write.</i>

00:10:51.960 --> 00:10:53.170
<i>I have to write </i>something<i>.</i>

00:10:57.760 --> 00:10:58.670
It's done.

00:10:59.490 --> 00:11:01.680
I should at least read over it one last time.

00:11:04.600 --> 00:11:05.780
What is this?

00:11:06.230 --> 00:11:09.740
I know I'm the one who wrote it, 
but I can't find anything that hooks me in.

00:11:10.220 --> 00:11:13.290
It has... zero entertainment value.

00:11:13.290 --> 00:11:14.650
Sensei.

00:11:14.940 --> 00:11:16.610
Y-Yes?

00:11:17.000 --> 00:11:20.400
I tried redrawing them for 
a more mainstream audience.

00:11:20.400 --> 00:11:21.680
What do you think?

00:11:25.760 --> 00:11:28.310
<i>Well, they're definitely less obscene,</i>

00:11:28.920 --> 00:11:31.290
<i>but the quality has declined drastically.</i>

00:11:34.800 --> 00:11:36.670
D-Double Peace-sensei?!

00:11:36.970 --> 00:11:38.480
I'm sorry.

00:11:38.480 --> 00:11:41.170
I can't draw the illustrations 
you have in mind.

00:11:41.970 --> 00:11:43.680
What are you saying?!

00:11:43.680 --> 00:11:45.430
Your art is incredible!

00:11:46.730 --> 00:11:51.350
This is what my art looked like four 
years ago when I first started drawing.

00:11:52.920 --> 00:11:53.460
What?

00:11:58.040 --> 00:11:59.570
When I first encountered eroge,

00:11:59.570 --> 00:12:03.700
I wanted to draw obscene, rape-filled 
illustrations from the bottom of my heart.

00:12:04.150 --> 00:12:06.950
I worked really hard so I could.

00:12:07.140 --> 00:12:10.950
<i>She went from this to being 
a top illustrator in just four years?</i>

00:12:13.230 --> 00:12:16.670
Why? How were you able to work that hard?

00:12:16.670 --> 00:12:20.670
Because I love the eroticism 
of brutal rape scenes.

00:12:26.490 --> 00:12:28.350
Onii-chan?

00:12:29.580 --> 00:12:30.700
Suzuka?

00:12:31.480 --> 00:12:33.980
<b>My Sister, 
My Writer</b>

00:12:35.940 --> 00:12:39.470
How's the scenario for the 
doujinshi coming along?

00:12:40.680 --> 00:12:41.900
Onii-chan?

00:12:42.350 --> 00:12:44.110
Don't worry.

00:12:44.710 --> 00:12:47.680
You just concentrate on getting better.

00:12:47.680 --> 00:12:48.910
No, I can't.

00:12:49.400 --> 00:12:51.760
What kind of story are you writing?

00:12:51.760 --> 00:12:53.070
Please tell me.

00:12:53.070 --> 00:12:54.160
Well...

00:12:54.830 --> 00:12:57.790
<i>I just can't fill in for you.</i>

00:12:58.080 --> 00:13:02.770
Onii-chan, please write the 
scenario how you want to write it.

00:13:02.770 --> 00:13:05.800
B-But... then, it won't be entertaining...

00:13:06.040 --> 00:13:09.550
Onii-chan, you love my work, right?

00:13:09.980 --> 00:13:11.140
I do.

00:13:11.710 --> 00:13:13.200
Of course I love it!

00:13:13.650 --> 00:13:14.810
That's why I...

00:13:15.000 --> 00:13:17.040
If you write with those feelings in mind,

00:13:17.040 --> 00:13:19.560
it'll be the best thing ever, right?

00:13:20.800 --> 00:13:22.320
I'm sure you'll be all right.

00:13:22.690 --> 00:13:27.820
Please write a doujinshi that 
lets me feel that love, Onii-chan.

00:13:29.070 --> 00:13:30.330
Suzuka...

00:13:37.710 --> 00:13:40.320
Double Peace-sensei! I'm sorry!

00:13:40.320 --> 00:13:42.210
Huh? What?

00:13:42.800 --> 00:13:47.470
I thought we'd need the support of 
lots of readers to win this showdown,

00:13:47.470 --> 00:13:49.010
so I've been playing it safe.

00:13:49.470 --> 00:13:52.720
And I was forcing you to follow my lead.

00:13:52.960 --> 00:13:58.730
But that's no different from how the 
Kanzaki sisters reject your artwork.

00:13:59.240 --> 00:14:01.550
The two of us create what we love to create!

00:14:02.110 --> 00:14:03.730
And that's good enough, isn't it?

00:14:04.040 --> 00:14:07.970
But if I draw what I love, it'll be obscene...

00:14:07.970 --> 00:14:09.160
Fine by me!

00:14:09.500 --> 00:14:10.190
Huh?

00:14:11.440 --> 00:14:16.220
You love my work from 
the bottom of your heart,

00:14:16.220 --> 00:14:18.460
so please draw what you really want to draw.

00:14:18.670 --> 00:14:20.030
Sensei...

00:14:21.120 --> 00:14:24.020
Doing that will produce 
the best artwork, right?

00:14:24.560 --> 00:14:26.200
So please...

00:14:26.200 --> 00:14:27.800
Draw what you want!

00:14:29.680 --> 00:14:31.040
I will!

00:14:31.040 --> 00:14:33.090
I really do love it!

00:14:33.090 --> 00:14:36.810
I love your work more than anything!

00:14:37.080 --> 00:14:39.940
So I'm gonna draw like crazy, doing what I love!

00:14:44.070 --> 00:14:45.480
<b>13th Comic Stage</b>

00:14:54.390 --> 00:14:56.520
Suzuka, don't push yourself.

00:14:56.520 --> 00:14:57.840
You're still recovering.

00:14:58.250 --> 00:15:01.520
Do you know how many days 
it's been since I got rid of my cold?

00:15:01.520 --> 00:15:03.530
Looks like you managed to finish your book.

00:15:07.470 --> 00:15:09.020
What are you two doing here?

00:15:09.670 --> 00:15:11.590
We wanted to say hello 
before the con opened.

00:15:12.440 --> 00:15:13.330
Um...

00:15:15.430 --> 00:15:18.020
It's considered polite 
to exchange new books.

00:15:18.020 --> 00:15:19.810
So give me yours in return.

00:15:25.880 --> 00:15:27.440
Wh-What the heck is this?

00:15:27.440 --> 00:15:28.950
Ah-he's usual garbage?

00:15:28.950 --> 00:15:31.000
N-No, this is even worse than normal.

00:15:31.890 --> 00:15:34.370
So, ultimately, you haven't made any progress!

00:15:35.220 --> 00:15:37.370
Looks like this contest is over.

00:15:39.870 --> 00:15:42.760
I look forward to your 
impending concession speech!

00:15:42.760 --> 00:15:44.430
Let's go, Onee-chan!

00:15:45.600 --> 00:15:46.600
Remember, everyone:

00:15:46.600 --> 00:15:50.130
The winner is determined by 
the reaction of the readers. So...

00:15:50.770 --> 00:15:52.850
Hey! Wh-What's this?

00:15:52.850 --> 00:15:54.840
Ambivalence's new volume?

00:15:57.850 --> 00:15:58.880
This is...

00:15:59.360 --> 00:16:01.980
Ambivalence's first erotic doujinshi.

00:16:02.350 --> 00:16:05.980
Runa-chan.... She really wants to win this, huh?

00:16:08.940 --> 00:16:12.910
<i>The 13th Comic Stage is 
now open to the public!</i>

00:16:28.800 --> 00:16:29.650
What's wrong?

00:16:30.220 --> 00:16:34.300
The line for their circle stretches 
right out the event hall.

00:16:34.670 --> 00:16:35.500
What?!

00:16:37.120 --> 00:16:40.020
It looks like a truckload 
of people got hyped for it

00:16:40.020 --> 00:16:44.020
because it's their first adult volume 
and it's based on Towano Chikai's series!

00:16:44.320 --> 00:16:45.650
Calm down.

00:16:45.650 --> 00:16:47.620
The contest isn't about sales.

00:16:47.620 --> 00:16:49.000
It's about reader response.

00:16:49.490 --> 00:16:51.790
But if there's a massive difference in sales,

00:16:51.790 --> 00:16:53.530
isn't that a sign of what readers think?

